        <div class="cx-faq-q">
          <h3>How long does the quote process take?</h3>
          <span class="cx-faq-icon"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="cx-faq-a"><p>We return detailed, itemized quotes within five business days of a site visit. For larger or more complex multi-trade projects, we will tell you upfront if additional review time is needed and give you an expected return date.</p></div>
