        <div class="cx-faq-q">
          <h3>What happens if the project falls behind schedule?</h3>
          <span class="cx-faq-icon"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="cx-faq-a"><p>We identify slippage as it happens — not after it has cascaded. When a trade falls behind, we resequence other work to keep the project moving. If recovery requires additional crew or extended hours, we deploy them. Your deadline does not move because we did not plan for contingency.</p></div>
      </div>
