        <div class="cx-faq-a"><p>Every scope change is documented in a formal written change order with the cost impact and schedule impact before work proceeds. No verbal approvals. No surprises on the final invoice. You approve in writing, then we proceed.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="cx-faq-item">
        <div class="cx-faq-q">
          <h3>How does the handoff process work?</h3>
          <span class="cx-faq-icon"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="cx-faq-a"><p>Before the client walkthrough, we do a full internal punch list inspection. We walk every room, every surface, every fixture. The resulting list typically has 15–30 items on a mid-size project. We close 80% same-day and the remainder within 48 hours. You receive full close-out documentation including permit closure confirmation.</p></div>
